  "description": "有着琥珀色左眼的赤王后裔，阿如村的守护者。",
  "affiliation": "阿如村",
  "cv": {
    "chinese": "张琦",
    "japanese": "柚木凉香",
    "english": "希瑟·冈萨雷斯",
    "korean": "全暎洙"
  },
  "avatarImg": "assets/characters/10000072-avatar.webp",
  "splashArt": "assets/characters/10000072-art.webp",
  "hasLocalPack": false,
  "voicePackageUrl": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/11-500/Candace.zip",
  "voicePackageEn": "Candace",
  "quoteCount": 70,
  "friendLines": [
    {
      "title": "初次见面…",
      "desc": "你好呀，远道而来的旅行者，夜晚的沙漠可是很严酷的，不如就在敝处稍住一晚吧，由我来照看你的无梦之夜。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_draw_appear_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8e/scd8qewxmabi2jlzl2x9ctg2h8uaspe.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "闲聊·盾与枪",
      "desc": "为了保护珍贵之物，只有盾是不够的。所以…我才会握起枪。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_character_idle_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d1/2ofw499zwu96xbgergdnevsdsxkmbjd.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "闲聊·生活",
      "desc": "希望每个人都平安无事。只要能维持这样的生活，我就心满意足了…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_character_idle_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/05/kx4eoezlog12rl5bojxebfi6avw1nu5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "闲聊·愿望",
      "desc": "无论以怎样的方法，我都希望守护住那些重要的东西。尽管有时…这会是一种奢望。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_character_idle_03",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4e/4d0uka7e3lyc8a01qlxhuqvaa2jxqpt.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "下雨的时候…",
      "desc": "可别着凉了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_weather_heavyRain_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/99/1xlmmjshx6615v3dd4s36me3cb15k7h.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "打雷的时候…",
      "desc": "雷声隆隆——会让你害怕吗？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_weather_thunder_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e5/q1o7l1zj6tqgzpfkvqj00ogsv2mbigp.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "下雪的时候…",
      "desc": "这些白色的东西，冰冰凉凉的…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_weather_snowy_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a9/nqjqx1bp9296h0dzc4hx439gm3u4dox.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "刮大风了…",
      "desc": "在沙漠里，这样的风会吹起沙暴，得小心了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_weather_gale_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7e/6ododwvgprkyqgi1csks1y5pn5go0eb.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "在沙漠的时候…",
      "desc": "我就在你身旁。若你不放心的话，就请牵着我的手吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_weather_desert_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/71/f92qbz97mhd7qdq2q3yes7v97cm5rjq.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "早上好…",
      "desc": "早上好啊，不知旅者昨夜可曾安然入眠？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_dialog_greetingMorning",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/32/5vxk04m4ktuews3bpqzp0y1jko2mfw3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "中午好…",
      "desc": "已经是中午了，天上明眸之光灼然炫目，不如找个荫凉处歇息一下吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_dialog_greetingNoon",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/39/tuwaqaivozld34lefk036gszyczoryl.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "晚上好…",
      "desc": "夜晚啊，在那光芒褪尽的诸多帷帐之后，藏着多少难言的隐秘呢…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_dialog_greetingNight",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/12/7t2gcd37ghw9eea9jk26pqgqt04l1wb.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "晚安…",
      "desc": "嗯，确实已经到休息的时间了，你先去睡吧。我吗？离我入睡的时候还早，夜晚虽然美丽却也危险，我得好好帮你守夜才行啊。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_dialog_greetingNight2",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/eb/f4l1zr589ofrin9ge5koyp9n4g0ft4c.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于坎蒂丝自己·瞳色",
      "desc": "很奇怪吗，不管是琥珀色还是蔚蓝色，应该都还算常见的瞳色吧…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_dialog_idle",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/63/i23s7qekgh42d7q77vwaj5ce4g1u9bq.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于坎蒂丝自己·阿如村",
      "desc": "我自小就在阿如村出生长大，在我尚且懵懂之时就知道，将来一定会从祖父手中接过守护阿如村的职责…如今，这已是我欣然接受的天职了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_dialog_idle2",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1c/1zh02l1evt74bjcfze5hrewuss83rsf.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于坎蒂丝自己·父母",
      "desc": "我的父亲是教令院的学者，当时为了研究才到了阿如村，也由此和我的母亲相遇。关于母亲的事，我全是从父亲口中得知的…在我出生那日，母亲就走入永夜之中了…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_dialog_idle3",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ee/d6nf76tyss5d7cisao8v7fgkrq5ghmb.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于我们·主客",
      "desc": "你永远是阿如村的客人，无论何时，若是在旅途中觉得困倦疲累，你都可以到这儿来歇息一会儿。阿如村永远欢迎你…我永远会欢迎你。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_dialog_close",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/dd/pjl1ltep5o6ydxxjkx9vztk6jv0uwlz.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于我们·宝匣之中",
      "desc": "据说每个人心中都有一个宝匣，他们将珍视之物装入匣中，花上一生的时间好好守护。这样想要守护的东西，在我的宝匣之中也有许多，要猜猜看都有什么吗？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_dialog_close1",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8c/p0j8ojm77t2ayuqkthmpo02r2ttm4xz.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「神之眼」…",
      "desc": "在我获得「神之眼」的时候，村里不少人都说这是阿赫玛尔的恩眷…但对我来说这并不重要。无论有没有神明的恩赐，我都会履行「守护者」的职责。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_dialog_pendant",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/52/7ymfp38p5bs4q5t0tqojp40s4j9ouzi.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "有什么想要分享…",
      "desc": "我很喜欢在阿如村度过的日子。同时，在这里度过的每一天也都在提醒我，如果我因为松懈失察而酿成大错的话，就再也无法回到这样的生活了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_dialog_share_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6c/cgpp5yetf98ak638baq72z29xn1rxem.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "感兴趣的见闻…",
      "desc": "你有在旅行的途中见过枣椰吗，村里的人经常把它们摘回来做成糖果吃，味道非常甜美。如果感兴趣的话，你也尝尝看吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_pref_gift_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/55/j0vbb10dj0u7uomuircy0u6ln5x0a0j.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于小吉祥草王…",
      "desc": "草神啊…作为阿赫玛尔血脉延续的我既然能在此安然生存，或许也仰赖她的仁慈吧。不过，虽说心中怀有淡薄的感激之念，但我毕竟是沙漠的子嗣…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_teammate_nahida_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/63/l60acak53qmmj0bo7bcd4u9mrt3yf3r.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于莱依拉…",
      "desc": "「状若梦游的古怪少女」么…我确实在防沙壁附近看到过，虽然完全听不懂她说的话和写在纸上的一堆算式…不过，她似乎说完那些心情变好了许多。或许这是她排解心中压力的方式吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_teammate_layla_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/34/5i40sf6yglvs8hor663tb65utwiwm7n.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于艾尔海森…",
      "desc": "真是奇怪的须弥学者，跟我接触过的其他学者都有些不太一样，他的想法与见解都很独到…希望他的这份锐利，不会打扰到阿如村的安宁吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_teammate_alhaitham_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/34/5i40sf6yglvs8hor663tb65utwiwm7n.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于赛诺…",
      "desc": "教令院的大风纪官…之前很少到防沙壁的这一侧来，最近却常常出现。关于他，镀金旅团里似乎流传着一些相当可怕的传说…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_teammate_cyno_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/de/j4wepzzvdpxq1489p3bfvo77fbzt9oe.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于迪希雅…",
      "desc": "迪希雅，她每次带着镀金旅团的人在阿如村寄宿的时候，都能约束好手下的行动，可以说…给我免了很多麻烦。迪希雅小姐，跟看上去大大咧咧的样子不同，是个非常可爱的人哦。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_teammate_dehya_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/77/2803nkh52oj31ti8z3uyex41nmgo4ow.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于赛索斯…",
      "desc": "赤王的子民永远保有骄傲，他也是如此。我听说了他的事，赫曼努比斯的威光将与有能力的人共存。听说他最近在须弥城很活跃，还跟赛诺他们提起阿如村，说是想来作客，我很期待。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_teammate_sethos_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/17/rcnv21ef0b2ge7cs6z7e1wsd65sp9ov.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解坎蒂丝·其一",
      "desc": "想要了解我的事情吗…那算不上是一个好故事，但要是你执意想听的话…那就在入夜之后，由我在篝火边为你讲述吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_friendship_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d0/1cof4zi4xfthyqi0u9ixtxk6tviyn67.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解坎蒂丝·其二",
      "desc": "我们是失去了神明庇护的一族，对我们而言，谎言不是什么敌人，没有明天才是。怀揣谎言行走于痛苦的荆棘之路上，说不定…说不定比自顾自拥抱真相死去的人要高尚一些呢…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_friendship_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/91/nqtf95dx52ecizntrd6e4ckjokx0tc9.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解坎蒂丝·其三",
      "desc": "即使到现在，也有人相信赤王有朝一日能够复活，但那是不可能的。一切的过去都如同被吹拂的砂砾，对过往之事来说，随风而去才是最好的归宿。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_friendship_03",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/80/nnzaucmsc79pb9om3qli2ho2z7nu7qc.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解坎蒂丝·其四",
      "desc": "我的盾牌？喔，如果按照村外人的说法，这面盾牌上可是有着「贝努」的祝福呢，只要拿着这面盾牌，沙漠里的每一颗沙砾都是我的斥候，沙暴也任我驱使…这其实都是外人的臆想。但无论如何，对我来说…至少这面盾牌用得挺顺手的。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_friendship_04",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a9/eia8oih5zyxcal5tcvjk5twl0yjnwnn.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解坎蒂丝·其五",
      "desc": "我真想用这只琥珀色的眼睛，预见你的未来…我想，它大概会是一片金黄，介于阳光和黄金之间，是充满希望的颜色。你的前路一定会顺利，我由衷祝福着它。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_friendship_05",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/28/au6hl7li72jjza7q71ak17b7so82ada.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "坎蒂丝的爱好…",
      "desc": "在村中散步就是我最喜欢做的事。看到一切都好，就让人觉得今日犹如昨天，昨天犹如过去，而过去又总是好的。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_pref_hobby",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b5/4ok4okw9mf6f6u75jwmif9xobk1lx8p.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "坎蒂丝的烦恼…",
      "desc": "偶尔还是会有不长眼的宵小之徒，企图打扰阿如村的宁静。或许…只将那些家伙赶进全是魔兽的山谷里还是太过仁慈了，怎么样，你有更好的建议吗？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_dialog_annoyed",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/67/0svczr9xbel38xhacksput184bn5oo0.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "喜欢的食物…",
      "desc": "对我来说…食物的分量比口味更重要。在沙漠里生活需要耗费比想象中更多的体力，一天的劳累过后，没有比吃饱肚子更为惬意的事了吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_pref_foodLike_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/08/fgthh8h1l7h5ay2x8op0lucmta1m7lh.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "讨厌的食物…",
      "desc": "倒也没到讨厌的程度，不过相较于肉，鱼吃起来确实非常麻烦…可能也是在沙漠中很少吃鱼的关系吧，我对于那种将刺从鱼肉中剔除的工作并不擅长…让你见笑了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_pref_foodDislike",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bf/bocbzctcjsgwlbnf8oiwks1uuncs96h.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其一",
      "desc": "好吃极了，为做出这样的美食，你想必付出了相当的努力吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_spice_pref_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6f/qdiil3g8qo8504qxb7dyfjkavymhx5x.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其二",
      "desc": "明明是四处漂泊的旅人，你做的饭，却有家的味道呢。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_spice_normal_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/85/h4jy93yvth09gglgvqh4pqsoydg2p9h.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其三",
      "desc": "或许是我对可食用之物的定义太过保守…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_spice_dislike_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/18/71bxzgm682frtgm0f45dt23hml251sw.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "生日…",
      "desc": "祝你生日快乐！多了不起啊，你在过去某年某月的这一天出生了。有什么想要实现的愿望吗。如果要去险远之处，我就作你旅途的护卫。若是想稍作休息，那就来阿如村，我用最好的烤肉和饮料招待你。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_pref_birthday_01",
      "localAudio": null,
