    {
      "title": "突破的感受·起",
      "desc": "感觉到了更坚实的力量，希望我可以保护更多…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_starUp_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/97/k1t5rj784w9oo2f4crfbyhiib4ky2u9.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·承",
      "desc": "更坚固的盾，和更锋利的枪。我曾听说过一个枪和盾的故事…不，我不会做出枪盾相击的尝试。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_starUp_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/53/dzuvfus1m44o2l35l7m3jypmworkths.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·转",
      "desc": "人在「现在」获得的力量，或许都是为了应对「将来」的不安。就像我过去锻炼枪术和持盾的技巧，实际上都是为了守护现在的安稳。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_starUp_03",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/95/7bj3uosunjax9i6comzldndtybm2tlx.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·合",
      "desc": "现在的我，已经可以站在你的身前，替你挡下所有的危险。如果你相信我的话，就请闭上双眼，将敌人交给我吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_candace/vo_candace_starUp_04",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/55/by8s35xb11jvhprjg3nf7neyq3qy2j3.mp3"
    }
  ],
